{"title": "尼采哲学经典（套装共5册）", "index": 87, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_\"><img class=\"calibre_10\" src=\"images/00087.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_\"><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">瑞士巴塞尔大学外景</span></span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_52\" src=\"images/00002.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_53\" src=\"images/00055.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">就读于普福塔高等学校时的尼采（16岁）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">德国哲学家尼采（1844～1900）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_54\" src=\"images/00086.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_55\" src=\"images/00014.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采15岁时写给母亲的书信手迹  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">莱比锡大学  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_56\" src=\"images/00008.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_21\" src=\"images/00006.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的父亲  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的母亲  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_43\" src=\"images/00105.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_26\" src=\"images/00012.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的妹妹伊丽莎白  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的红颜知己莎乐美  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_57\" src=\"images/00097.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_58\" src=\"images/00089.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的墓，德国莱比锡西南洛肯小镇教堂墓地  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采曾就读的普福塔高等学校  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_59\" src=\"images/00123.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_60\" src=\"images/00047.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">深刻影响尼采的德国哲学家叔本华（1788～1860）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">瓦格纳夫妇  </span></span><span cla